<title>TURKEY: Bulgarian tanker loads Iraqi oil at Turkey's Ceyha.</title>
<headline>Bulgarian tanker loads Iraqi oil at Turkey's Ceyha.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 135,000-tonne Bulgarian tanker was being loaded with Iraqi crude oil from Turkey's Ceyhan terminal and the tanker will sail for Bulgaria on Friday, Turkish officials said.</p>
<p>A pipeline official told Reuters the loading on the Artega began on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The loading will be completed either tonight or tomorrow morning. The tanker will leave the terminal tomorrow,&quot; said the official.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
